stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Connect
  s1: Greeting sent
  s2: Credentials accepted
  s3: Rejected
  s4: Ready
  s5: Statement starting
  s6: Cancellation available
  s7: Statement active
  s8: Statement complete
  s9: Cancellation requested
