  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Server sends greeting
  s1 --> s2: Password exchange succeeds
  s1 --> s3: Authentication fails
  s2 --> s3: Session capacity is full
  s2 --> s4: Session slot available
  s4 --> s5: Client submits a supported text statement
  s5 --> s6: Install cancellation watch
  s6 --> s7: Publish active statement
  s7 --> s8: Statement returns
  s7 --> s9: Client requests cancellation
  s8 --> s10: Client disconnects
  s9 --> s8: Statement returns
